    {
      "id": "d1", "accountId": "a2", "mailboxIds": ["a2-inbox", "a2-clients-halden"],
      "subject": "Halden Coffee: packaging, round two", "unread": true,
      "messages": [
        { "id": "d1m1", "minutesAgo": 2950, "from": { "name": "Maya Chen", "email": "maya@northwind.studio" },
          "to": [{ "name": "Alex Morgan", "email": "alex@northwind.studio" }, { "name": "Daniel Okafor", "email": "daniel@northwind.studio" }],
          "body": "Hi both,\n\nI've put the second round of the Halden bags in the shared file. Three directions:\n\n1. Kraft with a single ink colour, the logo stamped large\n2. Matte black with the origin map in a fine line\n3. The illustrated series, one animal per origin\n\nCould you each pick a favourite before Thursday's call?\n\nMaya" },
        { "id": "d1m2", "minutesAgo": 2700, "from": { "name": "Daniel Okafor", "email": "daniel@northwind.studio" },
          "to": [{ "name": "Maya Chen", "email": "maya@northwind.studio" }, { "name": "Alex Morgan", "email": "alex@northwind.studio" }],
          "body": "Two for me. The map is a story they can tell in the café, and it prints well on the small 250 g bags.\n\nOn Tue, Maya Chen wrote:\n> Could you each pick a favourite before Thursday's call?" },
        { "id": "d1m3", "minutesAgo": 1500, "from": { "name": "Alex Morgan", "email": "alex@northwind.studio" },
          "to": [{ "name": "Maya Chen", "email": "maya@northwind.studio" }, { "name": "Daniel Okafor", "email": "daniel@northwind.studio" }],
          "body": "Agree on two. Could we try the map in their warm brown instead of white? Black and white reads a little cold next to the shop.\n\nOn Tue, Daniel Okafor wrote:\n> Two for me. The map is a story they can tell in the café." },
        { "id": "d1m4", "minutesAgo": 40, "from": { "name": "Maya Chen", "email": "maya@northwind.studio" },
          "to": [{ "name": "Alex Morgan", "email": "alex@northwind.studio" }, { "name": "Daniel Okafor", "email": "daniel@northwind.studio" }],
          "body": "Done. The brown works much better, it feels like their counter now. Mock-ups attached, front and back.\n\nIf you're both happy I'll send it to Ingrid this afternoon.\n\nMaya\n\nOn Wed, Alex Morgan wrote:\n> Could we try the map in their warm brown instead of white?",
          "attachments": [{ "name": "halden-bag-front.png", "size": 1840000, "type": "image/png" }, { "name": "halden-bag-back.png", "size": 1620000, "type": "image/png" }] }
      ]
    },
