    {
      "id": "d5", "accountId": "a1", "mailboxIds": ["a1-inbox"],
      "subject": "Field Notes #112: the quiet interface", "unread": true,
      "messages": [
        { "id": "d5m1", "minutesAgo": 540, "from": { "name": "Field Notes", "email": "letters@fieldnotes.press" },
          "to": [{ "name": "Alex Morgan", "email": "alex@morgan.family" }],
          "body": "The best tools disappear while you work. This week: why hairlines beat shadows, how to choose a type scale you won't regret, and three apps that get motion right.\n\nRead online: https://fieldnotes.press/112",
          "html": "<div style=\"background:#f4f2ee;padding:32px 16px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:36px 40px 8px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font:600 12px/1 -apple-system,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a7f72\">Field Notes · Issue 112</p><h1 style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:normal\">The quiet interface</h1></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 40px 8px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6\"><p>The best tools disappear while you work. You notice them only when something goes wrong, and the rest of the time they hold still and let the work be the loudest thing on the screen.</p><p>This week we look at three small decisions that add up to that feeling:</p><ul style=\"padding-left:20px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><b>Hairlines over shadows.</b> A one-pixel line separates without lifting anything off the page.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><b>A type scale you won't regret.</b> Five sizes, used with discipline, beat twelve used freely.</li><li><b>Motion that explains.</b> Things should move the way they would if they were real: from somewhere, to somewhere.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 40px 36px\"><a href=\"https://fieldnotes.press/112\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#222;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font:600 15px/1 -apple-system,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:8px\">Read the full issue</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"max-width:560px;margin:20px auto 0;text-align:center;font:12px/1.5 -apple-system,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#8a7f72\">You're getting this because you subscribed at fieldnotes.press.<br><a href=\"https://fieldnotes.press/unsubscribe\" style=\"color:#8a7f72\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div>" }
      ]
    },
